    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/radiant-portfolio/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Radiant Portfolio Theme is a beautifully crafted template designed specifically to help creatives showcase their work effectively. Perfect for artists, photographers, graphic designers, videographers, writers, and other creative professionals, this theme empowers users to create a stunning online portfolio that highlights their skills and accomplishments. Whether you’re building a digital portfolio for a job application, personal branding, or presenting creative projects to potential clients, Radiant Portfolio provides the ideal platform for visibility and engagement. With its user-friendly interface and highly customizable portfolio layouts, built with a powerful page builder plugin for easy drag-and-drop editing, you can design a portfolio website that reflects your unique style and personality. The theme supports various portfolio categories, including photography, graphic design, videography, illustration, and digital art, while visual elements like interactive galleries, elegant animations, and responsive grids enhance the user experience. Optimized for SEO, fast loading, and mobile responsiveness, Radiant Portfolio ensures your projects are discoverable and engaging across all devices, making it an excellent choice for freelancers, creative agencies, and design studios."
    },
